{
  "//": "Shared masking test cases for ts_common.mask_detail (Python, canonical) and its Go counterpart (imprint-core tools/imprint-dev/typesafe.go MaskDetail, run by TestMaskParity in typesafe_test.go). All names/addresses/keys below are synthetic fixtures, never real data. 'names' lists the entries that must be present in TYPESAFE_NAMES_FILE for the 'name' category cases to hit.",
  "names": ["Max Mustermann", "Erika Musterfrau"],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_bearer",
      "text": "curl -H 'Authorization: Bearer sk-fake-AbC123XYZ0000' https://api.service.example/v1/x",
      "must_not_contain": ["sk-fake-AbC123XYZ0000"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_keyval_apikey",
      "text": "export API_KEY=fakeSecretValue999",
      "must_not_contain": ["fakeSecretValue999"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_keyval_password",
      "text": "password: fakeHunter2",
      "must_not_contain": ["fakeHunter2"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "email_simple",
      "text": "Kontakt: test.user@mail.example für Rückfragen",
      "must_not_contain": ["test.user@mail.example"],
      "min_counts": {"email": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "address_street_number",
      "text": "Lieferung an Musterstraße 12 bitte vor 18 Uhr",
      "must_not_contain": ["Musterstraße 12"],
      "min_counts": {"address": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "address_street_abbrev_with_letter_suffix",
      "text": "Neue Adresse: Hauptstr. 4b ab nächstem Monat",
      "must_not_contain": ["Hauptstr. 4b"],
      "min_counts": {"address": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "address_plz_ort",
      "text": "Wohnort laut Formular: 80331 München",
      "must_not_contain": ["80331 München"],
      "min_counts": {"address": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "name_full",
      "text": "Termin mit Max Mustermann am Dienstag",
      "must_not_contain": ["Max Mustermann"],
      "min_counts": {"name": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "name_second_person",
      "text": "Erika Musterfrau hat den Vertrag unterschrieben",
      "must_not_contain": ["Erika Musterfrau"],
      "min_counts": {"name": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "opaque_hash_like",
      "text": "commit ref abcdefABCDEF0123456789ghijkl for the release",
      "must_not_contain": ["abcdefABCDEF0123456789ghijkl"],
      "min_counts": {"opaque": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "negative_plain_command",
      "text": "pytest -q tests/test_api.py",
      "must_not_contain": [],
      "exact_counts": {"secret_kw": 0, "email": 0, "address": 0, "name": 0, "opaque": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": "negative_commit_message",
      "text": "fix: refresh token handling on reconnect",
      "must_not_contain": [],
      "exact_counts": {"secret_kw": 0, "email": 0, "address": 0, "name": 0, "opaque": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed_secret_and_email",
      "text": "token=abcd1234efgh5678, bitte an sync.bot@bots.test melden",
      "must_not_contain": ["abcd1234efgh5678", "sync.bot@bots.test"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1, "email": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "name_case_insensitive",
      "text": "bericht ueber max mustermann von gestern",
      "must_not_contain": ["max mustermann"],
      "min_counts": {"name": 1},
      "note": "Python's name regex is case-insensitive ((?i)). The Go port (imprint-core tools/imprint-dev/typesafe.go MaskDetail) matches this since imprint-core-CL-013a: the per-name regexp.MustCompile now carries an explicit (?i) prefix."
    },
    {
      "id": "address_plz_ort_generic_suffix",
      "text": "Wohnort laut Formular: 12345 Musterstadt am Fluss",
      "must_not_contain": ["12345 Musterstadt am Fluss", "Fluss"],
      "min_counts": {"address": 1},
      "note": "Python's PLZ+Ort pattern accepts any '(am|an der|im) <Capitalized word>' suffix generically. Since imprint-core-CL-013a, Go's plzOrtRE generalizes the 'am'/'an der' suffix the same way (any capitalized word); 'im'/'ob der' stay a fixed list (im Breisgau, ob der Tauber) so 'PLZ ist 10115 Berlin im Brief.' still leaves 'im Brief' unmasked (typesafe_test.go TestMaskAddresses) - a narrower parity than Python's fully generic 'im' handling, intentional and covered by both test suites."
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_db_pass",
      "text": "DB_PASS=Synth2024Secret!",
      "must_not_contain": ["Synth2024Secret"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_quoted_password_with_spaces",
      "text": "password = \"synth geheimes Passwort 2024\"",
      "must_not_contain": ["geheimes", "Passwort 2024"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_passphrase",
      "text": "passphrase: \"synth-correct-horse-9\"",
      "must_not_contain": ["correct-horse"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_passwd",
      "text": "passwd: synth2024x",
      "must_not_contain": ["synth2024x"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_credential",
      "text": "credential=SynthCred2024",
      "must_not_contain": ["SynthCred2024"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_private_key",
      "text": "private_key = \"synth-pk-material-7\"",
      "must_not_contain": ["pk-material"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_access_key",
      "text": "aws_access_key_id = SynthAccessKey2024",
      "must_not_contain": ["SynthAccessKey2024"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "secret_kw_auth",
      "text": "auth=synthAuthValue7 weiter",
      "must_not_contain": ["synthAuthValue7"],
      "min_counts": {"secret_kw": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "opaque_aws_key_id_akia",
      "text": "aws_id AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE im Log",
      "must_not_contain": ["IOSFODNN7EXAMPLE"],
      "min_counts": {"opaque": 1},
      "note": "20 characters, under the 24-character opaque limit; AWS's own documentation example."
    },
    {
      "id": "opaque_aws_key_id_asia",
      "text": "session ASIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE im Log",
      "must_not_contain": ["IOSFODNN7EXAMPLE"],
      "min_counts": {"opaque": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "iban",
      "text": "IBAN DE89 3704 0044 0532 0130 00 bitte",
      "must_not_contain": ["3704 0044", "0532 0130"],
      "min_counts": {"iban": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "phone_plus49",
      "text": "Tel. +49 221 12345678 tagsüber",
      "must_not_contain": ["12345678"],
      "min_counts": {"phone": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "phone_leading_zero",
      "text": "mobil 0171/1234567-8 abends",
      "must_not_contain": ["1234567"],
      "min_counts": {"phone": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "negative_dates_versions",
      "text": "Datum 01.01.2024, 04:06 Uhr, Version 0.12.3, Port 8080",
      "must_not_contain": [],
      "exact_counts": {"secret_kw": 0, "email": 0, "address": 0, "name": 0, "opaque": 0, "iban": 0, "phone": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": "opaque_known_prefix_short",
      "text": "refresh 1//0gSynthFixture7 ende",
      "must_not_contain": ["0gSynthFixture7"],
      "min_counts": {"opaque": 1},
      "note": "known token prefix without keyword, shorter than the 24-character opaque limit"
    }
  ]
}
